# reproduced and asserted headlessly so the page is not a stub: staleness categorisation
# (CategoryOf_and_BandOf_follow_the_web_thresholds), freshness formatting (FormatStaleness_matches_the_web_tiers,
# FormatStaleness_never_received_is_the_em_dash), the summary counts (Projection_summary_counts_match_the_categories),
# the row projection (Projection_rows_carry_the_band_label_value_and_time_since), the filter/sort/search pipeline
# (Projection_filter_stale_keeps_only_stale_and_never, Projection_filter_active_keeps_only_active,
# Projection_sort_alpha_orders_by_name, Projection_sort_staleness_puts_never_received_first,
# Projection_search_filters_by_name_case_insensitively), the catalog inner states
# (Projection_catalog_loading_shows_the_skeleton, Projection_catalog_empty_shows_the_no_data_state,
# Projection_catalog_error_shows_the_error_state, Projection_search_with_no_match_keeps_the_table_with_an_empty_message),
# the parsers (ParseList_reads_id_and_display_name, ParseLive_reads_value_and_timestamp_pairs,
# ParseLive_tolerates_a_bare_value_and_a_missing_signals_envelope), the view-model state machine
